    slug: "dharmapuri-krishnagiri-knitted-elastane-spinning-corridors",
    title: "Dharmapuri & Krishnagiri Knitted Elastane Spinning Corridors: High-Elasticity Spandex Coverings \u2014 Sourcing Guide",
